# SuperscriptSubscriptTool

**An open-source Microsoft Excel VBA application for applying superscript and subscript formatting.**

SuperscriptSubscriptTool is an Excel-based utility designed to make applying superscript and subscript formatting to text in Microsoft Excel easier and more convenient.

## Features

- Apply superscript formatting.
- Apply subscript formatting.
- Undo applied superscript formatting.
- Undo applied subscript formatting.
- User-friendly interface.
- Online help and documentation.
- Open-source VBA implementation.

## Getting Started

### Download

Download the latest release of `SuperscriptSubscriptTool.xlsm` from the [Releases](../../releases) page.

### Installation

1. Download the Excel workbook.
2. Open the downloaded `.xlsm` file in Microsoft Excel.
3. Enable macros if you trust the downloaded file and wish to use the application.
4. Follow the instructions in the application.

### Documentation

Consult the [User Guide](DOCS/Help.md) for instructions, examples and additional information.

